WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.533 --> 00:00:06.466
Now, a performance by our talented new star.

2
00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:09.666
So please give a warm welcome to Mademoiselle Shauna

3
00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:12.633
the winner of the Coumarine Pokémon Showcase.

4
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:18.966
I'm sure we can look forward to many fine performances from her in the future.

5
00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:22.833
Wow, it's so awesome that Shauna's famous now.

6
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.966
- She's famous all right.
- Pika.

7
00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:28.566
I've gotta practice hard so I can catch up to Shauna.

8
00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:33.500
Thanks for your patience. Your Pokémon are all fully recovered and feeling fine.

9
00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.533
Thanks, Nurse Joy.

10
00:00:38.866 --> 00:00:44.133
Fennekin? Pancham? Our next performance is coming soon, so let's train hard.

11
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.933
- Fenn!
- Pancham!

12
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

13
00:00:47.866 --> 00:00:49.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

14
00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:53.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

15
00:00:53.066 --> 00:00:54.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

16
00:00:54.533 --> 00:00:58.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

17
00:00:58.366 --> 00:01:01.633
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

18
00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:05.066
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

19
00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:09.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

20
00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:13.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

21
00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

22
00:01:19.533 --> 00:01:23.900
Battling With Elegance... And a Big Smile.

23
00:01:25.066 --> 00:01:28.433
With four Kalos Gym Badges in Ash's possession,

24
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:32.666
our heroes continue to the Lumiose Gym for Ash's battle with Clemont.

25
00:01:32.733 --> 00:01:36.200
Then Pancham will jump, go under here then finish up.

26
00:01:36.266 --> 00:01:38.266
I think we should give it a try, OK?

27
00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:41.733
Imagine Ash and Bonnie as a cheering crowd. All set?

28
00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:42.933
- Fenn.
- Pancham.

29
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.966
OK, let's go. -Can't wait.

30
00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:47.233
- Yippee!
- Ne!

31
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.066
- Show us how it's done.
- Pika, pika!

32
00:01:51.766 --> 00:01:55.266
Fennekin. Pancham. Now jump.

33
00:01:55.333 --> 00:01:57.366
- Fennekin!
- Pancham, cham!

34
00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:01.000
- Oh, wow.
- That was perfect.

35
00:02:01.066 --> 00:02:03.500
All that practising's really paying off, Serena!

36
00:02:06.166 --> 00:02:07.566
Pancham!

37
00:02:07.633 --> 00:02:10.166
- Go!
- Kin!

38
00:02:10.233 --> 00:02:12.066
- Whoa.
- Amazing.

39
00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:15.866
All right, Pancham, jump. Now use Flamethrower.

40
00:02:15.933 --> 00:02:18.100
Nekin! Pancham!

41
00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.300
-Pancham!

42
00:02:21.366 --> 00:02:23.800
- Ah! No, Pancham!
- Pancham, Pancham, Pancham!

43
00:02:23.866 --> 00:02:26.566
Cham, cham, cham, cham, cham, cham!

44
00:02:26.633 --> 00:02:27.900
Pancham.

45
00:02:27.966 --> 00:02:30.233
- Are you OK? Pancham?
- Cham...

46
00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:32.566
- Pancham!
- Fennekin!

47
00:02:32.633 --> 00:02:34.233
Cham, cham, Pancham!

48
00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.133
- Now stop fighting, both of you.
- Cham...

49
00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.533
It was nobody's fault.

50
00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:41.366
Our timing was off. So let's try it once more. 'Kay?

51
00:02:41.433 --> 00:02:42.433
- Fenne.
- Pancham.

52
00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:45.766
Pancham, cham, Pancham!

53
00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:47.233
Now let's do it.

54
00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.400
- Nekin!
- Pancham!

55
00:02:48.466 --> 00:02:50.200
-They did it. Yeah!

56
00:02:50.266 --> 00:02:52.300
Pa-a-a-a-an!

57
00:02:55.966 --> 00:02:59.066
- Ch... cham. Cha...
- Fennekin!

58
00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:01.700
- Pancham!
- Fenn!

59
00:03:02.066 --> 00:03:05.100
- Stop. Both of you. Huh?
- Pancham!

60
00:03:05.166 --> 00:03:07.533
Fennekin. Fennekin!

61
00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:09.866
- Cham, cham. Cham, cham.
- Huh?

62
00:03:11.266 --> 00:03:14.966
- Uh, come on, cut it out, now.
- You shouldn't fight.

63
00:03:15.033 --> 00:03:16.200
- Denne-ne.
- Pika, pika!

64
00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.466
- Fennekin!
- Cham!

65
00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:22.266
- Serena!

66
00:03:22.333 --> 00:03:24.000
Huh?

67
00:03:26.833 --> 00:03:29.700
I've had enough!

68
00:03:29.766 --> 00:03:32.366
Can you please take this seriously?

69
00:03:32.433 --> 00:03:34.500
- OK, now calm down.
- Huh?

70
00:03:34.566 --> 00:03:37.366
So you both know what you did wrong, don't you?

71
00:03:37.433 --> 00:03:40.166
- Pan, Pancham.
- Fenne.

72
00:03:42.733 --> 00:03:45.633
I think I need to go and take a little walk.

73
00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:48.266
- Huh?
- I wanna think things over alone.

74
00:03:48.333 --> 00:03:51.266
- Serena?
- Sorry.

75
00:03:51.333 --> 00:03:53.233
- Pan! Cham, cham.
- Serena?

76
00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:56.200
- Fenn, Fennekin!
- Pan, pan!

77
00:03:56.266 --> 00:03:59.733
- Fennekin! Fennekin!
- Pancham!

78
00:04:00.466 --> 00:04:04.633
Fennekin. Kin. Pancham.

79
00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:10.400
Ugh, of all the stupid...

80
00:04:10.466 --> 00:04:13.633
If I had won, that praise and glory would have been mine.

81
00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:16.700
That twerpy twerpette is taking away my spotlight.

82
00:04:16.766 --> 00:04:19.433
Now, now. There will always be a next time.

83
00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:20.633
Of course.

84
00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.133
And the next next time, I'm going to win.

85
00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.400
You tell them, Jess.

86
00:04:24.466 --> 00:04:27.333
And always remember James and I have got your back.

87
00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:31.133
Words of wisdom. I'm going to become the reigning Kalos Queen,

88
00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.533
cagey, crafty conqueror.

89
00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:35.000
Attaining the status of top Pokémon performer

90
00:04:35.066 --> 00:04:38.233
doesn't necessarily mean you'll be conquering all of Kalos.

91
00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.766
What's that supposed to mean?

92
00:04:39.833 --> 00:04:44.166
Queen. The title that will bring me adoration and region-wide praise.

93
00:04:44.233 --> 00:04:47.766
Yes. The entire world will bow down before me.

94
00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:51.500
First you get the performance power, then we get the Pokémon.

95
00:04:51.566 --> 00:04:54.266
Wow. I can see that.

96
00:04:54.333 --> 00:04:56.500
Wobbuffet.

97
00:04:58.733 --> 00:05:00.933
Oh.

98
00:05:01.933 --> 00:05:04.233
I was awful.

99
00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:07.500
I've had enough!

100
00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:12.033
To be totally honest, I think this one suits you much better.

101
00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:15.233
- Ah, suits me?
- Uh-huh.

102
00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:19.833
I thought you were wondering about which one of these was better.

103
00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.133
No, not at all.

104
00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:24.400
See, I was actually thinking about something else.

105
00:05:24.466 --> 00:05:26.933
- Hey. Don't look so sad.
- Huh?

106
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:31.266
Really. If you keep that look up, your poor face will wind up staying that way.

107
00:05:31.333 --> 00:05:34.200
- Huh? Ah! Ah!
- Always keep smiling.

108
00:05:34.266 --> 00:05:37.300
That's the secret for looking and feeling great.

109
00:05:37.366 --> 00:05:40.000
Heh. -That's right. Just like that.

110
00:05:40.066 --> 00:05:41.100
Huh?

111
00:05:41.166 --> 00:05:43.266
I know I've seen her somewhere before.

112
00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:44.833
Hey. I know.

113
00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:48.133
Why don't we shift gears and do some serious shopping together?

114
00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.633
- Huh?
- I finally have some time off,

115
00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.966
and I know there are some shops I've wanted to check out,

116
00:05:54.033 --> 00:05:55.933
but it's boring to go by myself.

117
00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.833
So. Please?

118
00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:58.933
Heh, sure.

119
00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.433
My name is A... Uh, my name's Ariana. Heh.

120
00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:06.266
- Nice to meet you.
- Hi. I'm Serena and it's nice to meet you.

121
00:06:06.333 --> 00:06:10.166
Great. Now, come on, Serena, the stores await. Heh.

122
00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:20.066
Of course! You know, I was wondering where I've seen you before.

123
00:06:20.133 --> 00:06:22.633
I saw you in the Pokémon Showcase.

124
00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:25.300
You saw the Coumarine Showcase, Ariana?

125
00:06:25.366 --> 00:06:29.466
I wasn't actually there in person, I watched it later on Pokévision.

126
00:06:29.533 --> 00:06:30.866
I sure goofed up.

127
00:06:30.933 --> 00:06:34.166
I made some big-time mistakes and then got eliminated.

128
00:06:34.233 --> 00:06:36.633
- And I got mad at my Pokémon today.
- Oh.

129
00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.733
I feel like I'm the worst Pokémon performer ever.

130
00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:44.166
Everybody makes mistakes. Nobody ever does it perfectly the first time.

131
00:06:44.233 --> 00:06:47.066
But Shauna sure did. She won it.

132
00:06:47.133 --> 00:06:51.000
I really wanna be just like Aria, the Kalos Queen.

133
00:06:51.066 --> 00:06:54.200
- It's what I dream about.
- Hm.

134
00:06:54.266 --> 00:06:57.300
- Come on, you're looking sad again.
- Huh?

135
00:06:57.366 --> 00:07:01.766
Serena? Between these two, which one do you think is better?

136
00:07:01.833 --> 00:07:06.266
- Let's see. That one.
- Really?

137
00:07:06.333 --> 00:07:08.433
Then this one it is. Wait.

138
00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:11.600
On second thought, this one's really cute, too.

139
00:07:11.666 --> 00:07:13.166
I can't decide.

140
00:07:14.166 --> 00:07:16.900
- See? There's that face.
- Huh?

141
00:07:16.966 --> 00:07:21.533
A Pokémon performer always has to wear a wonderfully radiant smile.

142
00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:25.800
That's the way you make everyone in your audience happy.

143
00:07:25.866 --> 00:07:30.900
Yeah.

144
00:07:30.966 --> 00:07:33.100
OK. Time to eat.

145
00:07:33.266 --> 00:07:35.600
- Pika, pika.
- Denne-ne-ne.

146
00:07:39.966 --> 00:07:42.033
Fennekin? Pancham?

147
00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.300
I'll bet you're worried about Serena.

148
00:07:44.366 --> 00:07:45.200
- Fenn.
- Cham.

149
00:07:45.266 --> 00:07:47.833
Don't worry. She'll be back in no time.

150
00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.633
He's right. And when Serena gets back here,

151
00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:54.666
if she finds out you didn't eat anything, she'll get really worried.

152
00:07:54.733 --> 00:07:55.733
- Cham?
- Kin?

153
00:07:57.300 --> 00:07:59.733
- Pancham. Pancham, Pancham.
- Kin!

154
00:08:00.966 --> 00:08:02.533
All right.

155
00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:05.866
Aw, I sure hope my big brother's doing all right.

156
00:08:05.933 --> 00:08:08.700
So your worries are about Clemont. Got it.

157
00:08:08.766 --> 00:08:13.033
Clemont can mess stuff up, so I get pretty worried when he's on his own.

158
00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.866
- Come on.
- Huh?

159
00:08:14.933 --> 00:08:16.633
Clemont always does the best he can.

160
00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.766
I bet he's at it right now.

161
00:08:22.066 --> 00:08:23.666
Treecko!

162
00:08:23.733 --> 00:08:25.300
You all right, Treecko?

163
00:08:25.366 --> 00:08:26.666
Treecko, Treecko!

164
00:08:26.733 --> 00:08:28.633
Chespin! Chespin, pin!

165
00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:30.866
Luxray, use Wild Charge.

166
00:08:30.933 --> 00:08:33.033
- Lux!
- Tree!

167
00:08:35.733 --> 00:08:41.900
Treecko is unable to battle. So, the winner is the Gym Leader, Clemont.

168
00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:46.600
Treecko, you were great. Awesome.

169
00:08:46.666 --> 00:08:49.733
You are so good. Gym Leaders are strong.

170
00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.466
You were quite good, too.

171
00:08:51.533 --> 00:08:54.300
But it was when you decided to use your Mega Drain

172
00:08:54.366 --> 00:08:57.966
that left you a big opening for me to make my counterattack.

173
00:08:58.033 --> 00:09:01.700
Oh, I got it now. That helps me a lot.

174
00:09:01.766 --> 00:09:03.833
Thank you very much for the tip.

175
00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:07.566
Wow. I feel like I'm really onto something.

176
00:09:07.633 --> 00:09:09.700
You'll see, Ash.

177
00:09:11.366 --> 00:09:13.633
Yum. This looks so good.

178
00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.966
We're in the famous café that's in all the guidebooks, right?

179
00:09:17.033 --> 00:09:19.433
Right. I've always wanted to come here and eat.

180
00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:23.100
So let's dig in. Ready?

181
00:09:23.166 --> 00:09:24.366
- Mm. Mm.
- Mm. Mm,

182
00:09:24.433 --> 00:09:26.666
It's delish!

183
00:09:28.433 --> 00:09:32.133
It just melts in your mouth. Right, Fennekin? Oh.

184
00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:36.066
Hm, you two are always together, aren't you?

185
00:09:36.133 --> 00:09:40.866
Yeah. Fennekin and I have been together since the very beginning of my journey.

186
00:09:40.933 --> 00:09:46.066
And although Pancham isn't always upfront with me, it's very sweet and lots of fun.

187
00:09:46.133 --> 00:09:51.133
I know they're doing the best they can, training for Pokémon Showcases, but...

188
00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:56.466
Here, Furfrou. Open wide. Is it yummy?

189
00:09:56.533 --> 00:09:57.400
Furfrou!

190
00:09:57.466 --> 00:10:00.900
Aw. That tickles.

191
00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:07.333
Maybe they won't wanna perform with me any more.

192
00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:10.266
- They're your precious friends, right?
- Huh?

193
00:10:10.333 --> 00:10:14.100
- Do you want things to stay like this?
- Huh.

194
00:10:14.166 --> 00:10:18.000
Serena, I'm sure anything that's important to you

195
00:10:18.066 --> 00:10:22.166
is something your Pokémon really care about too.

196
00:10:22.233 --> 00:10:25.000
Huh. You think so?

197
00:10:25.066 --> 00:10:27.900
First off, why don't you apologise to them?

198
00:10:27.966 --> 00:10:30.866
Even if you had a fight, you can always make up,

199
00:10:30.933 --> 00:10:33.000
which is what makes you true partners, right?

200
00:10:33.066 --> 00:10:36.066
Right.

201
00:10:37.066 --> 00:10:39.933
Who's that Pokémon?

202
00:10:44.066 --> 00:10:46.333
It's Treecko.

203
00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:48.233
Treecko.

204
00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.600
Not acceptable.

205
00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.666
Not at all.

206
00:10:54.733 --> 00:10:58.500
- Yeah. You can scream that again.
- Pay attention..

207
00:10:58.566 --> 00:11:02.000
I need to put on a flashier and more elegant performance

208
00:11:02.066 --> 00:11:04.066
to become queen, isn't that right?

209
00:11:04.133 --> 00:11:08.333
- Pal, you gotta help me out.
- Leave me out of this.

210
00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:10.233
Now, get up. Pronto.

211
00:11:11.633 --> 00:11:17.433
- Why do I have to get up, too?
- Argh! Because I said so.

212
00:11:18.433 --> 00:11:20.700
Ready? Get it.

213
00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:24.133
- Ne, ne, ne, ne!
- Pi, Pikachu!

214
00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.866
Pikachu!

215
00:11:26.933 --> 00:11:28.000
- Pan.
- Kin.

216
00:11:28.066 --> 00:11:31.600
- What is it, Fennekin?
- Huh?

217
00:11:31.666 --> 00:11:33.633
Serena.

218
00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:36.333
Hi, everyone. I'm back.

219
00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:40.633
Hm. Come on, you two. No time like the present.

220
00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:42.033
- Fenne.
- Pancham.

221
00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:44.766
See? They both feel really bad about what happened,

222
00:11:44.833 --> 00:11:46.833
and they've been worried about you.

223
00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:50.300
Don't feel bad. I messed up. I'm sorry.

224
00:11:50.366 --> 00:11:53.000
- Fenn! Fenne, fenn, fenn!
- Oh!

225
00:11:53.066 --> 00:11:55.233
-Cham, cham, cham, cham.

226
00:11:55.300 --> 00:12:00.066
Being away made me realise something. You two are my precious partners.

227
00:12:00.133 --> 00:12:02.033
- Fennekin.
- Pancham, cham.

228
00:12:02.733 --> 00:12:06.166
- I'm so happy that you guys made up.
- Pikachu

229
00:12:06.233 --> 00:12:09.166
So these Pokémon are your partners, Serena?

230
00:12:10.533 --> 00:12:13.433
Mm-hm, you've got such a good connection.

231
00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:16.433
- Who are you?
- Oh, this is Ariana.

232
00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.366
- I met her in town.
- Hi. My name's Ash.

233
00:12:19.433 --> 00:12:22.833
- And up on top is my partner, Pikachu.
- Pikachu

234
00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:26.533
- Bonnie's my name. This is Dedenne.
- Denne, denne.

235
00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.900
Nice to meet you.

236
00:12:28.966 --> 00:12:33.400
Ah! Wow, you're a keeper. Although my brother's not here right now,

237
00:12:33.466 --> 00:12:36.133
I'd sure like it if you'd take care of him.

238
00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:37.900
Uh, take care of him?

239
00:12:37.966 --> 00:12:41.433
- Well, uh...
- Can you stop, Bonnie?

240
00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:45.600
- Well, it's just that Ariana's so pretty.
- Now, isn't that sweet?

241
00:12:45.666 --> 00:12:48.133
I'll introduce you two when we see him.

242
00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:51.900
- He's a really dependable brother.
- Heh.

243
00:12:51.966 --> 00:12:55.566
Hey, Serena. Wanna have a Double Battle against me?

244
00:12:55.633 --> 00:12:56.466
Huh?

245
00:12:56.533 --> 00:12:59.900
You might learn a lot by battling with your Pokémon now.

246
00:12:59.966 --> 00:13:02.033
And I think it would be a lot of fun.

247
00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:08.033
- Battling with my Pokémon? Huh.
- Sounds like a great idea to me.

248
00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.233
You think so?

249
00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:13.066
Now you've made up, show her what an awesome team the three of you can be.

250
00:13:13.133 --> 00:13:16.466
I think you're right. I'll give it a shot.

251
00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:21.200
- Pika, pika!
- Denne-ne!

252
00:13:21.266 --> 00:13:23.966
- Serena, you can do it.
- Go for it.

253
00:13:24.033 --> 00:13:26.200
Thanks for the opportunity.

254
00:13:26.266 --> 00:13:28.833
Now I'm gonna bring out my Pokémon.

255
00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:31.100
Come on out, Delphox. Aromatisse.

256
00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:34.933
- Delphox!
- Aromatisse!

257
00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.933
Wow, Aria's partners. Uh...

258
00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:43.233
Aromatisse. The Fragrance Pokémon and the evolved form of Spritzee.

259
00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:44.933
Aromatisse can create many scents,

260
00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:48.266
some unpleasant enough to opponents to gain the advantage in battle.

261
00:13:48.333 --> 00:13:50.966
Huh? Mm.

262
00:13:51.033 --> 00:13:55.233
Delphox. The Fox Pokémon and Fennekin's final evolved form.

263
00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:58.300
By focusing on the flame at the tip of its branch,

264
00:13:58.366 --> 00:14:01.166
Delphox can see into the future.

265
00:14:02.233 --> 00:14:05.166
Fennekin's final evolved form. Hm.

266
00:14:05.233 --> 00:14:07.700
Fennekin. Pancham. Let's do our best.

267
00:14:07.766 --> 00:14:09.400
- Fenn!
- Pancham, cham!

268
00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:12.966
All right then, let's get going.

269
00:14:15.966 --> 00:14:18.833
Fennekin, Scratch, let's go.

270
00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:20.066
Fenne!

271
00:14:20.133 --> 00:14:22.100
Aromatisse, use Reflect.

272
00:14:22.166 --> 00:14:25.666
Aromatisse!

273
00:14:25.733 --> 00:14:28.200
- Nekin!
- It got blocked.

274
00:14:28.266 --> 00:14:31.400
Now, Delphox, use Mystical Fire.

275
00:14:31.466 --> 00:14:33.966
Delphox!

276
00:14:34.033 --> 00:14:37.100
Pancham! Pancham!

277
00:14:37.166 --> 00:14:40.500
- Pancham. Are you OK?
- Whoa, that was amazing. Wow.

278
00:14:40.566 --> 00:14:43.933
That's what I'd expect from Fennekin's final evolved form.

279
00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:48.733
It's so beautiful to watch, the way Delphox and Aromatisse battle.

280
00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:51.166
Well? How do you like our performance?

281
00:14:51.233 --> 00:14:57.466
- Huh? You're a Pokémon performer, Ariana?
- That's right. I forgot tell you.

282
00:14:57.533 --> 00:15:00.533
So this is a performers' battle?

283
00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:04.033
Right. And the performance is just getting started.

284
00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:06.500
Right. Pancham, use Stone Edge on Aromatisse.

285
00:15:06.566 --> 00:15:09.366
Pancham!

286
00:15:10.933 --> 00:15:12.600
- So cool.
- Wait.

287
00:15:12.666 --> 00:15:16.166
- Looks like the Reflect is still active.
- Huh?

288
00:15:16.233 --> 00:15:18.600
- You have to work together.
- Huh?

289
00:15:18.666 --> 00:15:21.233
The cooperation between trainer and Pokémon

290
00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:25.100
and between Pokémon themselves is important in a double battle.

291
00:15:25.166 --> 00:15:27.633
You can't win if you don't work together.

292
00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:31.700
We can't win if we don't work together. Huh?

293
00:15:31.766 --> 00:15:36.233
That's right, it's what Ash always says when he battles.

294
00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:39.366
All right. Let's trust each other and work together!

295
00:15:39.433 --> 00:15:40.266
- Fenn!
- Pancham!

296
00:15:40.333 --> 00:15:42.200
Pancham. Use Stone Edge.

297
00:15:42.266 --> 00:15:44.266
Pancham!

298
00:15:46.433 --> 00:15:49.600
Fenn, fenn, Fennekin!

299
00:15:49.666 --> 00:15:54.033
- Reflect won't block an attack from above.
- Fennekin, use Flamethrower.

300
00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:56.200
Fennekin!

301
00:15:56.266 --> 00:15:59.233
- Counter it with Flamethrower, too.
- Phox!

302
00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:03.066
Ah! Fennekin!

303
00:16:03.133 --> 00:16:07.266
- Fenn!
- Fennekin.

304
00:16:07.333 --> 00:16:10.466
- Use Charge Beam.
- Aromatisse!

305
00:16:11.466 --> 00:16:13.733
- Pancham!
- Fenn.

306
00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.600
Pancham, Dark Pulse, let's go.

307
00:16:15.666 --> 00:16:17.666
Cham! Pan, pan!

308
00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:19.200
Aroma!

309
00:16:19.266 --> 00:16:23.433
What am I supposed to do? What can I do?

310
00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.300
Fennekin.

311
00:16:25.366 --> 00:16:26.933
Pancham.

312
00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.700
No. I can't do anything.

313
00:16:31.333 --> 00:16:34.633
Always has to wear a wonderfully radiant smile.

314
00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:38.733
Ah! My smile. Fennekin. Pancham.

315
00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:42.500
Don't worry, I truly believe in you two.

316
00:16:42.566 --> 00:16:46.733
After all, you're the greatest partners in the whole wide world.

317
00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:48.733
- Cham.
- Fennekin.

318
00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.733
Fenne,

319
00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:55.533
- Whoa! Check it out.
- What's going on?

320
00:17:00.166 --> 00:17:01.300
Fennekin?

321
00:17:01.933 --> 00:17:03.466
Fenn?

322
00:17:03.533 --> 00:17:05.466
- Hi, Fennekin.
- Kin!

323
00:17:05.533 --> 00:17:06.833
- Fenn!
- Mm!

324
00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.133
- Kin!
- Mm!

325
00:17:17.233 --> 00:17:18.233
Braixen.

326
00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.466
- It evolved.
- That's awesome.

327
00:17:20.633 --> 00:17:23.666
Pancham!

328
00:17:28.333 --> 00:17:32.500
Braixen. The Fox Pokémon and the evolved form of Fennekin.

329
00:17:32.566 --> 00:17:36.566
Braixen uses friction to ignite the twig from its tail before a battle.

330
00:17:36.633 --> 00:17:37.733
Brai.

331
00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:40.733
- You see?
- Huh?

332
00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:43.566
Your Pokémon answered your heartfelt call.

333
00:17:43.633 --> 00:17:47.966
Just like I said. Your two hearts became one.

334
00:17:48.033 --> 00:17:48.966
Braix.

335
00:17:51.333 --> 00:17:54.500
Right. And thank you so much.

336
00:17:54.566 --> 00:17:56.966
Now, this battle's really heating up.

337
00:17:57.033 --> 00:17:59.700
Time to show us the bond between all of you.

338
00:17:59.766 --> 00:18:02.600
-Right. OK, here we come.

339
00:18:02.666 --> 00:18:05.733
Use Flamethrower and Dark Pulse. Perfect partners.

340
00:18:06.766 --> 00:18:09.500
Brai, Braixen!

341
00:18:09.566 --> 00:18:12.566
Pancham!

342
00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.833
- Look at that.
- That is so cool.

343
00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:25.700
Those moves! What you did with them just now was amazing.

344
00:18:25.766 --> 00:18:28.200
It was! Thank you so much.

345
00:18:28.266 --> 00:18:30.733
I guess it's time now for me to get serious.

346
00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:33.100
Yeah, and me too.

347
00:18:33.166 --> 00:18:34.500
- Huh?
- Huh?

348
00:18:34.566 --> 00:18:37.233
- Oh, no. It's time already?
- What's going on?

349
00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:38.533
Hello?

350
00:18:39.566 --> 00:18:42.133
- I know. I'll be back right away.
- Ariana?

351
00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:46.366
I'm so sorry, guys. I kind of have to go back now.

352
00:18:47.933 --> 00:18:51.866
- But there's a battle going on.
- We'll have to end it here.

353
00:18:51.933 --> 00:18:53.966
- No way.
- You were both great.

354
00:18:54.033 --> 00:18:57.366
- Thanks, Delphox, Aromatisse.
- Ariana.

355
00:18:57.433 --> 00:18:59.866
I don't know how to thank you for today.

356
00:18:59.933 --> 00:19:04.300
Heh, and don't forget, you've got a great smile to show off.

357
00:19:04.366 --> 00:19:07.300
Thanks, I'll remember that.

358
00:19:07.366 --> 00:19:11.266
- Let's meet on stage someday.
- Definitely.

359
00:19:11.333 --> 00:19:15.400
- Heh. See you.
- Bye.

360
00:19:15.466 --> 00:19:18.233
- Thanks for everything.
- Bye-bye.

361
00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:20.133
- Brai?
- Huh?

362
00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.866
Xen.

363
00:19:21.933 --> 00:19:26.566
You were amazing too, Braixen. So were you, Pancham.

364
00:19:26.633 --> 00:19:27.733
-Braix!

365
00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:28.800
Pancham.

366
00:19:38.966 --> 00:19:41.033
Let's get to Lumiose City.

367
00:19:41.100 --> 00:19:43.966
Clemont's waiting there. Bet he's excited.

368
00:19:44.033 --> 00:19:45.666
- 'Kay, Clemont, here we come.
- Pika!

369
00:19:47.166 --> 00:19:48.933
You sure are pumped up, Ash.

370
00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:51.366
Yeah. I can't wait for my next Gym Battle.

371
00:19:51.433 --> 00:19:53.533
- Ladies and gentlemen.
- Huh?

372
00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:55.366
The time has finally come.

373
00:19:55.433 --> 00:19:59.666
The time for Kalos Queen Mademoiselle Aria's breathtaking performance.

374
00:19:59.733 --> 00:20:00.766
Here she is.

375
00:20:05.933 --> 00:20:08.466
I can't believe how cute Aria is.

376
00:20:09.366 --> 00:20:10.800
Huh.

377
00:20:18.566 --> 00:20:20.100
I'll do my best.

378
00:20:20.166 --> 00:20:24.666
And someday, I'll be as great as a Pokémon performer as you, Aria.

379
00:20:24.733 --> 00:20:26.500
You'll see.

380
00:20:27.966 --> 00:20:29.500
What are you waiting for?

381
00:20:29.566 --> 00:20:31.233
-Pika.

382
00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:34.000
What's the hurry, Serena? Hey, wait for me.

383
00:20:34.066 --> 00:20:38.533
And so, after some advice from none other than the Kalos Queen,

384
00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:43.100
Serena's partnership with her Pokémon has grown just a little bit closer,

385
00:20:43.166 --> 00:20:46.500
as the journey continues.
